      "title_type": 1,
      "description": "Indulge in the Mise en scene Perfect Serum Treatment 330ml, a highly nutritious solution for achieving soft, luscious hair from roots to tips. This effective home care treatment is designed for daily use, delivering 7 essential nutrients that leave your hair free from damage. Its unique coating effect shields your strands from external factors, ensuring a smooth and glossy finish every time.\n\nThe Nourishing Rich Balm Formulation of this treatment boasts a thick texture that stays put even when exposed to water, providing your hair with intensive nutrition and care. Revel in its lovely floral scent, enhanced with refreshing notes of citrus and green apple, complemented by the delicate fragrances of orange blossom and lily of the valley.\n\nWhat's more, this treatment seamlessly blends with any shampoo or serum, adding a gentle touch of its charming fragrance to your hair care routine.\n\nKEY INGREDIENTS:\nEnriched blend of 7X Golden Oil to repair & revive damaged hair to a soft and stronger hair!\n\nArgan\nOlive\nJojoba\nMarula\nApricot\nCoconut\nCamellia\n\nHOW TO USE:\n1. After shampooing, apply the treatment all over your hair except the scalp, focusing on the tips.\n2. Massage the product into your hair using your hands, leaving it on for 2-3 minutes.\n3. Rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water to reveal beautifully nourished and revitalized hair.\n\n\n\n\n",
