          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Enriched blend of 7X Golden Oil to repair & revive damaged hair to a soft and stronger hair!",
